---
import CarouselSection from './CarouselSection.astro';
---

<section class="memory-section design-section" aria-labelledby="memory-title">
  <div class="design-container">
    <div class="memory-header" data-reveal>
      <div>
        <span class="design-eyebrow">04 / Nuestra memoria compartida</span><h2
          id="memory-title"
          class="design-heading"
        >
          Granada, vista<br /><em>desde la ULP.</em>
        </h2>
      </div>
      <div class="memory-intro">
        <p>
          Las finales, los reencuentros y ese «una más». Hay cosas que se
          entienden mejor en fotos.
        </p><a href="/info/ediciones_anteriores" class="design-link"
          >Recorre nuestras ediciones <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="memory-frame">
      <div class="memory-caption">
        <span><i aria-hidden="true"></i> RECUERDOS DE 2025</span><span
          >ETSIIT / GRANADA</span>
      </div>
      <CarouselSection
        albumId="72177720328590176"
        userId="195749897@N03"
        featuredPhotoId="54744102704"
        withBackground={false}
        height="580px"
      />
      <div class="memory-bottom">
        <span>Hecho de partidas. Y de personas.</span><span aria-hidden="true"
          >ULP / ARCHIVO ABIERTO ↗</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
<style>
  .memory-section {
    border-block: 1px solid var(--line);
    background: var(--surface);
  }
  .memory-header {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: end;
    gap: 40px;
    margin-bottom: 42px;
  }
  .memory-header .design-eyebrow {
    margin-bottom: 25px;
  }
  .memory-header h2 {
    max-width: 760px;
  }
  em {
    font-family: Georgia, serif;
    font-weight: 400;
  }
  .memory-intro {
    max-width: 290px;
  }
  .memory-intro p {
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 13px;
    line-height: 1.85;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }
  .memory-intro .design-link {
    font-size: 11px;
  }
  .memory-frame {
    padding: 25px;
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: 24px;
    background: var(--paper);
    box-shadow: 0 24px 60px rgb(0 68 101 / 0.06);
  }
  .memory-caption,
  .memory-bottom {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 20px;
    font:
      9px ui-monospace,
      monospace;
    color: var(--muted);
  }
  .memory-caption {
    padding: 0 8px 24px;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
  }
  .memory-caption > span:first-child {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 9px;
  }
  .memory-caption i {
    width: 6px;
    height: 6px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--ink);
  }
  .memory-frame :global(.container) {
    padding-inline: 0;
  }
  .memory-bottom {
    padding: 24px 8px 0;
    font-size: 8px;
  }
  @media (max-width: 700px) {
    .memory-header {
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: start;
      gap: 25px;
    }
    .memory-intro {
      max-width: 100%;
    }
    .memory-frame {
      padding: 14px;
      border-radius: 18px;
    }
    .memory-caption {
      font-size: 7px;
      padding: 5px 0 18px;
      gap: 8px;
    }
    .memory-bottom {
      padding-inline: 0;
      line-height: 1.7;
    }
    .memory-bottom > span:last-child {
      display: none;
    }
  }
</style>
